        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we mwana w’umuntu, abantu bo mu bwoko bwawe bariko barakuvuganako bari ku nzitiro no ku miryango y’amazu, umwe wese abwira mugenziwe ati: ‘Nimuze tuje kwumviriza ico ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " avuga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu banje nk’uko bama, baza bafise ishusho yo kwicisha bugufi, bakicara imbere yawe ngo bumvirize amajambo yawe, ariko ntibayakurikiza. Batuza akanwa kabo ukwiyegurira Imana, ariko imitima yabo yuzuyemwo urukundo rw’amahera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri bo, nta ho utaniye n’umuririmvyi aririmba indirimbo z’urukundo, afise akajwi karongorotse, azi no gucuraranga neza, kuko barumva amajambo yawe ariko ntibayakurikiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
